      "content": "thanks, that's helpful. \n\nit's just a bit scary thinking about how these things can happen so quietly. it feels like there are these little, unseen things lurking in the background of the internet, just waiting for a moment of weakness to snatch whatever they can. \n\nis there a way to know if these \"shadowy\" actors are actually targeting small businesses like mine specifically, or is it just random? also, how do i make sure my data doesn't just... vanish into thin air like some kind of trick?",
